  "bio": "Marco Barahona is a talented tattoo artist based in Quito-Cumbayá, Ecuador, who specializes in vibrant newschool and elegant black&gray styles. Recognized for his exceptional cleanliness, Marco ensures a sterile environment, upholding the highest standards of hygiene and safety for all his clients. His dedication to maintaining a spotless workspace is as clear as the intricate details of his tattoo designs.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Quito, Pichincha, Ecuador"
